From: sss@dark-alexandr.net
Date: Sun, 9 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] ik-llama-fix-unknown-tensors: gracefully handle missing engram.layer_ids and unknown tensors

- deepseek41.engram.layer_ids made optional (ml.get_arr_n with false flag)
- Added n_unknown counter to llama_model_loader
- Strange-name tensors (per_layer_token_embd.weight, etc.) counted as unknown
- Unknown tensors (engram_gate, engram_kv from mainline GGUF) counted as unknown
- done_getting_tensors accepts n_unknown mismatches gracefully

